  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 18 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nElevated and north-facing, this solidly built home is waiting for someone to bring it up to date and make the most of its full potential. Constructed in brick and cedar with a concrete tile roof, it offers generous proportions, good flow and a fantastic location in the heart of Mairangi Bay.\r\n\r\nThe interior is ready for modernising, giving you the chance to add your own style and create a home you’ll love for years to come.\r\n\r\nLeave the car at home and walk to the supermarket, sports clubs, cafés, restaurants, shops and, of course, the beach. With a bus stop close by, public transport is easily accessible too.\r\n\r\nInside, you’ll find three bedrooms, two bathrooms and a large rumpus room, along with a separate laundry and an extra-large double garage with internal access. The living areas flow out to front and rear decks, with a garden to enjoy as well. There’s also plenty of off-street parking.\r\n\r\nZoned for excellent schools: Rangitoto College, Westlake Girls' High School, Murrays Bay Intermediate and Mairangi Bay Primary. This is a great opportunity to secure a well-built home in a sought-after coastal location and make it your own.\r\n\r\nBring your paintbrush and ideas - the potential is here, and the location is hard to beat!",
